{
  "slug": "short-mihna",
  "id": "short-mihna",
  "title": "The one who would not bend",
  "note": "Ahmad ibn Hanbal endured the mihna without ever blaming the scholars who gave in around him.",
  "short": true,
  "chapters": [
    {
      "id": "the-short",
      "title": "The one who would not bend",
      "theme": "nutvoid",
      "short": true,
      "beats": [
        {
          "kind": "plate",
          "plate": "a-row-of-figures-bent-under-pressure-w",
          "hold": 48.5,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Everyone else bent. One man refused",
              "sub": "a test forced on every scholar in 833",
              "size": "hook",
              "at": 0.0,
              "until": 6.43
            },
            {
              "text": "Baghdad, Iraq, from the year 833",
              "sub": "a scholar named Ahmad ibn Hanbal",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 6.77,
              "until": 12.56
            },
            {
              "text": "Pressure comes down on the whole row",
              "sub": "say the Qur'an was created, or be ruined",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 12.9,
              "until": 19.64
            },
            {
              "text": "One man alone contradicts the state",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 19.98,
              "until": 23.47
            },
            {
              "text": "His stand becomes a standard for others",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 23.81,
              "until": 27.62
            },
            {
              "text": "Flogged before the caliph, he refuses",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 27.96,
              "until": 31.59
            },
            {
              "text": "Yet he never blames those who give in",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 31.93,
              "until": 35.66
            },
            {
              "text": "Creed still rests on evidence, not decree",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 36.0,
              "until": 39.94
            },
            {
              "eyebrow": "Ahmad ibn Hanbal, Baghdad",
              "text": "He would not say the words demanded",
              "sub": "his collection of hadith reports",
              "src": "The Musnad, 27,000 reports, 780 to 855",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 40.28,
              "until": 48.21
            }
